"LeafSong University is an elite Artonan university on Artona III, an alien Ivy League school."
"It teaches the wizard ruling class; losing admission there is a serious threat to students."
"Its jungle campus spreads over forested hills of wood-and-glass buildings."
"Black-and-green carnivorous plants with digesting pods grow there, and dark red lamps light it."
"Short clover-like ground cover, lime-green birds and dinosaur-like squawks fill the campus."
"There is no traffic; self-balancing carts carry people around campus."
"It has a rubbery sports field, a gym and a conference building with ferns on its roof."
"The conference building's doors dissolve into sparks."
"The exam building sits on a hilltop, with a wall of windows over the jungle canopy."
"The exam lab is a stark white basement the size of a football field, with 75 lab tables."
"The exam lab has reagent fridges, irradiator ovens and a teleport alcove for disposing of trash."
"Failed exam projects are moved to the lab's 'Corner of Shame'."
"LeafSong summons Avowed staff for its entrance exams, including a human medical team."
"Staff may not socialize with examinees outside work; any infraction brings a lifetime ban."
"Staff sleep on a curfew enforced with sleeping pills."
"Students run exam personnel for extra credit; Bti-qwol coordinated staff one year."
"Superior Professor Worli Ro-den, 'Joe', teaches there as a sentence and grades harshly."
"A jungle pool in its wildlife preserve was the site of an illicit mishnen summoning."
"The Achievement Society Gala, for faculty and prospects, has thirteen costumed Avowed waiters."
"Its medical team takes emergencies and puts responders on mandatory mental-health leave."
"A group of human Avowed, the boater, has held LeafSong staff jobs for decades."
"LeafSong is the second-best wizarding university; the best is on the Mother."
"Artona III's climate suits Artonans better; the campus is always about ninety degrees Fahrenheit."
"Stuart, son of the Primary, attends LeafSong after passing its entrance exams."
